==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|barbarus||foreigner, savage|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|βάρβαρος||foreign, strange|tr=barbaros|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

